<section id="timeline" class="timeline-section">
	<div class="timeline-container">
		<div class="timeline-header">
			<h2 class="timeline-title">Nuestra Noche Mágica</h2>
			<div class="title-decoration">
				<span class="decor-line"></span>
				<span class="decor-diamond">✦</span>
				<span class="decor-line"></span>
			</div>
			<p class="timeline-subtitle">Hay momentos que se convierten en recuerdos eternos, y hoy uno de <strong> mis grandes sueños se hace realidad. </strong>
Con la bendición de Dios y el amor de mi familia, llega la noche más esperada: mis quince años.
Como toda princesa, quiero compartir esta celebración mágica con las personas especiales de mi vida. Tu presencia hará de este día un recuerdo inolvidable.
Acompáñame a celebrar la magia de mis quince años.</p>
		</div>
		
		<div class="timeline-wrapper">
			<!-- Central Vertical Timeline Line -->
			<div class="timeline-line">
				<div class="timeline-progress" id="timeline-progress-bar"></div>
			</div>
			
			<!-- Event 1: Recepción -->
			<div class="timeline-item left scroll-animate" data-time="18:00">
				<div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
					<div class="timeline-dot"></div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-card">
					<span class="event-time">6:00 PM</span>
					<h3> 🎉Bienvenida</h3>
					<p>Recepción de invitados y familiares en el salón principal. Comienzan las emociones y la música ambiental.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<!-- Event 2: Entrada -->
			<div class="timeline-item right scroll-animate" data-time="19:00">
				<div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
					<div class="timeline-dot"></div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-card">
					<span class="event-time">7:00 PM</span>
					<h3>Entrada Real</h3>
					<p>La presentación oficial de la quinceañera. Un brindis especial para agradecer su presencia y celebrar la vida.</p>

				<img src="/assets/012.png" alt="Sharon Valeria - 12">
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<!-- Event 3: Vals -->
			<div class="timeline-item left scroll-animate" data-time="21:00">
				<div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
					<div class="timeline-dot"></div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-card">
					<span class="event-time">21:00 Hrs</span>
					<h3>El Gran Vals</h3>
					<p>El tradicional baile de gala con el padre, corte de honor y familiares cercanos. El momento más mágico e inolvidable.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<!-- Event 4: Cena -->
			<div class="timeline-item right scroll-animate" data-time="21:30">
				<div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
					<div class="timeline-dot"></div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-card">
					<span class="event-time">21:30 Hrs</span>
					<h3>Cena de Gala</h3>
					<p>Un banquete especialmente diseñado para deleitar sus paladares, acompañado de una agradable serenata instrumental.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			
			<!-- Event 5: Fiesta -->
			<div class="timeline-item left scroll-animate" data-time="23:00">
				<div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
					<div class="timeline-dot"></div>
				</div>
				<div class="timeline-card">
					<span class="event-time">23:00 Hrs</span>
					<h3>Apertura de Pista</h3>
					<p>¡El baile de carnaval y la fiesta comienzan! Luces, música en vivo y sorpresas para bailar y disfrutar hasta el amanecer.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.timeline-section {
		padding: 120px 0;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-bg-light) 0%, var(--color-bg-alt) 50%, var(--color-bg-light) 100%);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.timeline-container {
		max-width: 1100px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 20px;
	}

	.timeline-header {
		text-align: center;
		margin-bottom: 80px;
	}

	.timeline-pre {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 3px;
		color: var(--color-blue-600);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.timeline-title {
		font-size: 3rem;
		color: var(--color-text-dark);
		margin-top: 10px;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.title-decoration {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 15px;
		margin: 15px 0 25px 0;
	}

	.decor-line {
		width: 80px;
		height: 1.5px;
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--color-silver-400), transparent);
	}

	.decor-diamond {
		color: var(--color-silver-400);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}

	.timeline-subtitle {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		color: var(--color-silver-600);
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-size: 1rem;
	}

	/* Timeline Wrapper & Line */
	.timeline-wrapper {
		position: relative;
		margin-top: 50px;
		padding: 40px 0;
	}

	.timeline-line {
		position: absolute;
		left: 50%;
		top: 0;
		bottom: 0;
		width: 3px;
		background: var(--color-silver-300);
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		border-radius: 2px;
	}

	.timeline-progress {
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		left: 0;
		width: 100%;
		height: 0%;
		background: var(--gradient-blue-metallic);
		box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.6);
		transition: height 0.1s linear;
		border-radius: 2px;
	}

	/* Timeline Items */
	.timeline-item {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		width: 50%;
		padding: 30px 40px;
		position: relative;
		box-sizing: border-box;
		opacity: 0.3;
		transform: scale(0.85);
		transition: transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), 
					opacity 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
		will-change: transform, opacity;
	}

	.timeline-item.right {
		align-self: flex-end;
		margin-left: 50%;
		justify-content: flex-start;
	}

	.timeline-item > img {
		width: 8rem;
	}

	/* Timeline Dots */
	.timeline-dot-wrapper {
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		transform: translateY(-50%);
		z-index: 5;
	}

	.timeline-item.left .timeline-dot-wrapper {
		right: -10px;
	}

	.timeline-item.right .timeline-dot-wrapper {
		left: -10px;
	}

	.timeline-dot {
		width: 16px;
		height: 16px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: #ffffff;
		border: 3px solid var(--color-silver-400);
		box-shadow: 0 0 0 rgba(148, 163, 184, 0);
		transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
	}

	/* Active dots when scrolled into view */
	.timeline-item.active-dot .timeline-dot {
		background: #ffffff;
		border-color: var(--color-blue-600);
		box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.8);
		transform: scale(1.3);
	}

	/* Timeline Cards styling */
	.timeline-card {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		border: 1.5px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8); /* Silver border */
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		padding: 30px;
		border-radius: 16px;
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-metallic);
		max-width: 440px;
		width: 100%;
		transition: border-color 0.4s ease, box-shadow 0.4s ease;
		position: relative;
	}

	.timeline-card::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);
		width: 12px;
		height: 12px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
		border-style: solid;
		border-width: 1px;
		border-color: transparent;
	}

	.timeline-item.left .timeline-card::after {
		right: -7px;
		border-top-color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
		border-right-color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
	}

	.timeline-item.right .timeline-card::after {
		left: -7px;
		border-bottom-color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
		border-left-color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);
	}

	.timeline-item.visible .timeline-card {
		border-color: rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.5); /* glow metallic blue border */
		box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.08), 
					0 1px 3px rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.03);
	}

	.event-time {
		display: inline-block;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #1e40af; /* metallic deep blue */
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		letter-spacing: 1px;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
		background: rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.08);
		padding: 4px 10px;
		border-radius: 20px;
	}

	.timeline-card h3 {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-size: 1.5rem;
		color: var(--color-text-dark);
		margin-bottom: 12px;
	}

	.timeline-card p {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: var(--color-silver-600);
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	/* Responsive Timeline (shifts to single-sided on small screens) */
	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.timeline-line {
			left: 30px;
		}

		.timeline-item {
			width: 100%;
			justify-content: flex-start;
			padding-left: 60px;
			padding-right: 10px;
			margin-bottom: 30px;
		}

		.timeline-item.right {
			margin-left: 0;
			justify-content: flex-start;
		}

		.timeline-item.left .timeline-dot-wrapper {
			left: 20px;
			right: auto;
		}

		.timeline-item.right .timeline-dot-wrapper {
			left: 20px;
		}

		.timeline-card::after {
			left: -7px !important;
			right: auto !important;
			border-color: transparent !important;
			border-bottom-color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8) !important;
			border-left-color: rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8) !important;
		}
	}
</style>

<script>
	const timelineItems = document.querySelectorAll('.scroll-animate');
	const progressBar = document.getElementById('timeline-progress-bar');
	const timelineWrapper = document.querySelector('.timeline-wrapper');

	const checkScroll = () => {
		if (!timelineWrapper || !progressBar) return;

		// 1. Calculate overall timeline line progress
		const wrapperRect = timelineWrapper.getBoundingClientRect();
		const wrapperHeight = wrapperRect.height;
		
		// Determine how far down the scroll matches the center of viewport
		const centerOfScreen = window.innerHeight * 0.5;
		const scrolledPastTop = centerOfScreen - wrapperRect.top;
		
		let progressPercentage = (scrolledPastTop / wrapperHeight) * 100;
		progressPercentage = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, progressPercentage));
		
		progressBar.style.height = `${progressPercentage}%`;

		// 2. Animate timeline cards based on distance to viewport center
		timelineItems.forEach(item => {
			const rect = item.getBoundingClientRect();
			const elementCenter = rect.top + rect.height / 2;
			
			// Only animate when inside or close to the viewport
			if (rect.top < window.innerHeight && rect.bottom > 0) {
				// Normalize position relative to viewport center
				// 0 = at bottom of viewport, 1 = at top of viewport
				const totalRange = window.innerHeight + rect.height;
				const currentPos = window.innerHeight - rect.top;
				const progress = currentPos / totalRange; // 0 to 1
				
				// Symmetrical scaling centering at 0.5 (middle of the screen)
				// centerFactor will be 1 at exact middle, and drop to 0 at edges
				const centerFactor = 1 - Math.abs(0.5 - progress) * 2;
				
				// Clamp to positive range
				const clampedFactor = Math.max(0, centerFactor);
				
				// Size scaling: 0.85 -> 1.0 (resizes with scroll!)
				const scaleVal = 0.85 + (clampedFactor * 0.15);
				
				// Opacity scaling: 0.3 -> 1.0
				const opacityVal = 0.3 + (clampedFactor * 0.7);
				
				// Apply styles
				(item as HTMLElement).style.transform = `scale(${scaleVal})`;
				(item as HTMLElement).style.opacity = `${opacityVal}`;

				// Activate the dot when the scroll line passes the dot center
				// Dot center relative to wrapper
				const itemCenterY = rect.top - wrapperRect.top + rect.height / 2;
				const progressY = (progressPercentage / 100) * wrapperHeight;

				if (progressY >= itemCenterY - 10) {
					item.classList.add('active-dot');
				} else {
					item.classList.remove('active-dot');
				}

				// Mark as fully visible if it's near center
				if (clampedFactor > 0.4) {
					item.classList.add('visible');
				} else {
					item.classList.remove('visible');
				}
			} else {
				// Reset when completely out of viewport
				(item as HTMLElement).style.transform = 'scale(0.85)';
				(item as HTMLElement).style.opacity = '0.3';
				item.classList.remove('active-dot', 'visible');
			}
		});
	};

	// Register scroll and resize listeners
	window.addEventListener('scroll', checkScroll);
	window.addEventListener('resize', checkScroll);
	
	// Trigger initially on load
	document.addEventListener('website-ready', () => {
		setTimeout(checkScroll, 100);
	});
	
	// Fallback check
	setTimeout(checkScroll, 2000);
</script>
